/// M07 CORE-035 "bundled mixed questions: live semantics and gates".
/// Source: tests/integration/questions_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledMixedQuestions.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/native/questions.can
/// (classifier L5-11, report L13-38, likelihood L40-44, choose L46-52,
/// dynamic L54-64, rate L66-75, weights L77-82, levels L84-90, arms
/// L92-108, spread L110-115, spread_weights L117-125, assess L127-144,
/// roundtrip L146-156, main L158-176, helpers L178-212) plus the staged
/// raw fixtures questions_assess.json and complete.json.
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the live 8-question batch path (verbatim
/// request, protocol headers, five answer kinds across q0-q7), the
/// invalid-answer runtime rejection, the duplicate/handler/record
/// pre-launch gates with request silence, the lower-confidence
/// fallback, the nested two-stage followup (verbatim second-stage
/// request, complete judge, 5 mixed requests), and the raw-provider leg
/// (authless build, verbatim request comparison under a deny-network
/// sandbox, passed report with pinned evidence, emitted shape,
/// strict-ts iff).
/// The 8-root green pin lives in core-035-roots-green.can; the production
/// process shape lives in core-035-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: normal (Go L136-146), invalid (L147-151), duplicate
/// (L154-161), handler fault (L167-176), record fault (L181-192),
/// confidence fallback (L197-211), two-stage followup (L212-265), raw
/// provider (L267-340).
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_I27_TOKEN is harness-supplied
/// (Go L123: "test-only"), not an external gate. Logical gates
/// SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live
/// run now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L62).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case bundled/questions-semantics checks: batch-request,
/// request-headers, answer-kinds, invalid-answer, invalid-silent,
/// duplicate-rejects, duplicate-silent, handler-rejects, handler-silent,
/// record-rejects, record-silent, confidence-fallback, second-stage,
/// followup-judge, two-stage, mixed-requests, raw-build-exit,
/// raw-request, raw-sandbox, raw-report, emitted-shape, strict-ts.
/// Facet map (questions_test.go legs): batch-request pins the first-stage
/// batch body verbatim (L143-146: requests is 1 and bodies[0] equals want
/// or the test errors); request-headers pins the live protocol (L80:
/// POST to /systemone with Bearer [REDACTED] and application/json);
/// answer-kinds pins the q0-q7 kind vector (L70 response types grounded
/// in the fixture asks: noul, choice, choice, score, record-choice,
/// record-score, choice, record-choice; five distinct kinds);
/// invalid-answer pins the invalid-answer rejection (L149-151: diag
/// contains "error":"ai::invalid_answer"); invalid-silent pins the
/// rejection shape (L149: nonzero exit with empty stdout or the test
/// fatals); duplicate-rejects pins the duplicate-criterion gate (L155:
/// "build verification failed" plus "unused fixture"); duplicate-silent
/// pins the gate silence (L158-161: requests stay 2 or the test fatals);
/// handler-rejects pins the handler-fault gate (L169: "build
/// verification failed"); handler-silent pins its silence (L172-176:
/// requests stay 2); record-rejects pins the record-fault gate (L185:
/// "build verification failed"); record-silent pins its silence
/// (L188-192: requests stay 2); confidence-fallback pins the fallback
/// output verbatim (L203-205: exit 0 with "NfgCDEFLGRLH" and empty
/// stderr); second-stage pins the followup request verbatim (L84-89:
/// the "previous" body equals want or the test errors); followup-judge
/// pins the nested judge (L213-236: complete with float previous, live
/// previous 10, staged previous 0.5); two-stage pins the two-stage
/// output verbatim (L256-258: exit 0 with "NBSCDEFLGRLH" and empty
/// stderr); mixed-requests pins the phase count (L262: exactly 5);
/// raw-build-exit pins the authless build (L275-278: build exits 0);
/// raw-request pins the raw comparison (L312-314: POST to /systemone
/// with accept/content-type JSON and the L143 batch bytes);
/// raw-sandbox pins the deny-network harness profile (L333 verbatim);
/// raw-report pins the raw assertion (L316-317: passed with evidence
/// raw-provider-fixture and real-can); emitted-shape pins the compiled
/// wiring (L295-302: entry.ts $canMain import with exactly 1 shared
/// runtime); strict-ts pins the optional leg (L285-290: strict tsc over
/// emitted entry.ts runs if and only if CAN_TSC is set).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
